  "raw": " you are your scars!\nIt'll be sad when you find this book.\nNot even a good book\nI mean, for the first 4 parts it is really enjoyable, but 5 and 6 are meh. They go full retard on plot for no reason other than for people to get upset at the \"lolololol alien invasion, lololol.\"   6 is the one people are most likely to recommend because it's basically the best book, but 4-6 get pretty boring.\nIf he wants to read about aliens invading Earth and discovering other species, I think the only book better and probably more accessible is 'I Am Legend'.",
